WEBVTT

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.351
that we don't often wish to share.

00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:03.976
And so we hide,

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:08.476
and we hide behind what we like to call
the floodgate of intimacy.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.893
(Laughter)

00:03:10.917 --> 00:03:13.559
And what might that floodgate be holding?

00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:16.893
What is the dike upon which it is built?

00:03:16.917 --> 00:03:18.893
Well, first off --

00:03:18.917 --> 00:03:24.268
(Laughter)

00:03:24.292 --> 00:03:28.476
we found that it's different
for six different genotypes.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.833
(Applause)